="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4 bg-syntax-deleted/8"><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 pr-4 pl-3 text-right select-none text-syntax-deleted" style="width:4ch">-</span><span class="sr-only">removed: </span><span class="whitespace-pre"><span class="line"><span class="hl-k">@task</span><span class="hl-fg">(</span><span class="hl-se">'list'</span><span class="hl-p">,</span><span class="hl-fg"> [</span><span class="hl-se">'on'</span><span class="hl-k"> =></span><span class="hl-se"> 'homestead'</span><span class="hl-fg">])</span></span></span></span><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4 bg-syntax-inserted/8"><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 pr-4 pl-3 text-right select-none text-syntax-inserted" style="width:4ch">+</span><span class="sr-only">added: </span><span class="whitespace-pre"><span class="line"><span class="hl-k">@task</span><span class="hl-fg">(</span><span class="hl-se">'list'</span><span class="hl-p">,</span><span class="hl-fg"> [</span><span class="hl-se">'on'</span><span class="hl-k"> =></span><span class="hl-fg"> [</span><span class="hl-se">'homestead'</span><span class="hl-p">,</span><span class="hl-se"> 'staging'</span><span class="hl-fg">]])</span></span></span></span><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 pr-4 pl-3 text-right text-syntax-gutter select-none" style="width:4ch"></span><span class="sr-only"></span><span class="whitespace-pre"><span class="line"><span class="hl-fg">    ls -lah</span></span></span></span><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 pr-4 pl-3 text-right text-syntax-gutter select-none" style="width:4ch"></span><span class="sr-only"></span><span class="whitespace-pre"><span class="line"><span class="hl-k">@endtask</span></span></span></span></code></pre></div>
<h2 id="running-tasks">Running Tasks</h2>
<p>To run Envoy tasks you simply use run command:</p>
<div data-code-frame="true" class="not-prose relative my-8 bg-[var(--p-code-block-color-bg)] py-4 text-sm leading-[1.7] text-syntax-text"><div class="mb-3 flex items-baseline gap-4 border-b border-dashed pr-3 pb-3 pl-3 font-mono text-xs"><span class="min-w-0 truncate text-syntax-text">terminal</span><span class="text-syntax-comment max-sm:hidden">1<!-- --> <!-- -->line</span><button type="button" class="font-mono text-xs text-syntax-comment transition-colors hover:text-primary ml-auto">copy</button></div><pre class="overflow-x-auto font-code"><code class="block w-max min-w-full"><span class="flex min-h-[1.7em] pr-4"><span class="whitespace-pre pl-3"><span class="line"><span class="hl-f">envoy</span><span class="hl-s"> run</span><span class="hl-s"> list</span></span></span></span></code></pre></div>
<p>which will execute the task we defined above. Result is:</p>
